rippled image - XRPL Node — honeycluster/nodekit
=========================================

Binary:       /opt/ripple/bin/rippled
Config:       /opt/ripple/etc/rippled.cfg
Validators:   /opt/ripple/etc/validators.txt
Scripts:      /opt/ripple/scripts/
Logs:         /var/log/rippled/debug.log
Data:         /var/lib/rippled/db/
Logrotate:    /etc/logrotate.d/rippled

Useful commands
---------------
  rippled server_info                              Show server status
  rippled validation_create                        Generate a validator key pair
  rippled --conf /opt/ripple/etc/rippled.cfg       Start rippled manually
  cat /opt/ripple/etc/rippled.cfg                  View current config

Scripts
-------
  ./scripts/entrypoint.sh    Container entrypoint (runs on start)
  ./scripts/startup.sh       Daemon mode with logrotate
  ./scripts/shutdown.sh      Graceful shutdown
  ./scripts/logrotate.sh     Log rotation setup

Environment
-----------
  NETWORK          Network to connect to (mainnet, testnet, devnet)
  PATH             Includes /opt/ripple/bin

Aliases
-------
  Config is symlinked for default search paths:
    /etc/opt/ripple/rippled.cfg -> /opt/ripple/etc/rippled.cfg
    /etc/opt/xrpld/rippled.cfg  -> /opt/ripple/etc/rippled.cfg

Documentation:  https://github.com/honeycluster/nodekit/blob/develop/docs/rippled/
Config Ref:     https://github.com/honeycluster/nodekit/blob/develop/docs/xrpld/configuration.md
Source:         https://github.com/XRPLF/rippled
